{"id":"visita","lemma":"visita","pos":"noun","rank":906,"glosses":["visit","visitor, visitors","view"],"ipa":"/biˈsita/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"visitas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-visita.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Por qué visita Australia?","en":"Why are you visiting Australia?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302412"},{"text":"Disfrutó de esas visitas.","en":"He enjoyed those visits.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519496"},{"text":"¿Esta es su primera visita?","en":"Is this your first visit?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/99917"},{"text":"No tuvimos muchas visitas este verano.","en":"We didn't have many visitors this summer."},{"text":"¿Visita mucha gente el museo?","en":"Is the museum visited by many people?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705923"}]}